WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Crouching medium punch begins the corner confirm.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.050
Forward and crouching heavy punches continue after the Drive Rush cancel.

3
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:03.500
Heavy Adamant Flame connects beside the corner.

4
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.850
The forward-heavy-punch follow-up launches Ryu upward.

5
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.150
Light Gou Shoryuken catches Ryu beside the corner.

6
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:07.750
Ryu falls close to Akuma after the juggle.
